    "detailed_description": "Duckthing is a weird duck.<br>You can rotate the room.<br>Help this weird duck by rotating the room.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886950/extras/e646dd064d3335961cac23617cdf0e85.poster.avif?t=1733779861\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886950/extras/e646dd064d3335961cac23617cdf0e85.webm?t=1733779861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886950/extras/e646dd064d3335961cac23617cdf0e85.mp4?t=1733779861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You'll jump, fall, push stuff around each level to work your way to the goal. With over 60 levels and 6 islands, you'll find different objects to get past the challenges between you and the goal.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886950/extras/252843cae84bb3862fafb8a5eb4529bf.poster.avif?t=1733779861\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886950/extras/252843cae84bb3862fafb8a5eb4529bf.webm?t=1733779861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Duckthing is a weird duck.<br>You can rotate the room.<br>Help this weird duck by rotating the room.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886950/extras/e646dd064d3335961cac23617cdf0e85.poster.avif?t=1733779861\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886950/extras/e646dd064d3335961cac23617cdf0e85.webm?t=1733779861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886950/extras/e646dd064d3335961cac23617cdf0e85.mp4?t=1733779861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You'll jump, fall, push stuff around each level to work your way to the goal. With over 60 levels and 6 islands, you'll find different objects to get past the challenges between you and the goal.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886950/extras/252843cae84bb3862fafb8a5eb4529bf.poster.avif?t=1733779861\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886950/extras/252843cae84bb3862fafb8a5eb4529bf.webm?t=1733779861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
